WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000
A helicopter flies above flooded New Orleans neighborhoods.

00:14.000 --> 00:33.000
The camera looks down toward survivors on residential rooftops. A helicopter hoist carries people upward.

00:33.000 --> 01:02.000
Aerial views show buildings and streets surrounded by floodwater.

01:02.000 --> 01:15.000
The helicopter approaches another rooftop rescue.

01:15.000 --> 01:22.449
A rescue swimmer and survivor rise toward the helicopter doorway.
